  art: {fileID: 21300000, guid: a4b86fd768368584d88a439ef0d8211a, type: 3}
  monologue:
  - 'Among the now muffled cheers of the crowd

    and the trembling of my heart,

    I
    could hear the clear sound of rustling of leaves.'
  - 'In it, I reminisced the freshness

    of the land I had left behind.'
